    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“The tide does not argue. It collects.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Undertow Grip (tier/Soma Break).</strong> When a creature within 2 squares moves willingly, you may use your reaction to slow them; their speed becomes 0 until the end of the turn unless they succeed on a Violence defense check against your DC.</p>\n        <p><strong>Fluid Form.</strong> You reroll the lowest die on checks to avoid being knocked prone, and you can squeeze through tight spaces without squeezing penalties.</p>",
